/* 视觉规范 v1：说明 12 灰 → 12 → 地址白卡（内边距 16，卡间 12）；卡尾操作条用 1px 线隔开 */
.address-page { padding: var(--xy-space-3) var(--xy-layout-page-padding-x) var(--xy-space-6); color: var(--xy-color-text-primary); }
.address-intro { margin-bottom: var(--xy-space-3); padding: 0 var(--xy-space-1); }
.address-intro > text { display: block; color: var(--xy-color-text-muted); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-small-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); }
.address-card { box-sizing: border-box; min-height: var(--xy-size-touch-min); padding: var(--xy-space-4) var(--xy-space-4) 0; border-radius: var(--xy-radius-lg); background: var(--xy-color-surface); }
.address-card + .address-card { margin-top: var(--xy-space-3); }
.address-card:active { background: var(--xy-color-surface-subtle); }
.address-person { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--xy-space-1) var(--xy-space-2); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-line-height); }
.address-person > text:first-child { color: var(--xy-color-text-strong); font-weight: var(--xy-text-weight-semibold); }
.address-phone { color: var(--xy-color-text-secondary); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
.default-chip { display: inline-flex; height: 20px; align-items: center; padding: 0 var(--xy-space-1); border-radius: var(--xy-radius-sm); background: var(--xy-color-brand-light); color: var(--xy-color-brand); font-size: var(--xy-text-caption-size); font-weight: var(--xy-text-weight-bold); line-height: var(--xy-text-caption-line-height); }
.address-line { display: block; margin-top: var(--xy-space-1); color: var(--xy-color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-small-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.address-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--xy-space-6); margin-top: var(--xy-space-3); padding: var(--xy-space-3) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--xy-color-divider); color: var(--xy-color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-small-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); }
.address-actions > .address-action { position: relative; display: block; min-height: 0; line-height: var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); }
.address-actions > .address-action:first-child { color: var(--xy-color-brand); font-weight: var(--xy-text-weight-medium); }
.address-actions > .address-action:last-child { color: var(--xy-color-text-muted); }
.actions-spacer { flex: 1; }
.address-error { display: block; margin-top: var(--xy-space-3); color: var(--xy-color-danger); font-size: var(--xy-text-body-small-size); line-height: var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); }
.touch-overlay { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; width: 100% !important; height: 100%; min-width: var(--xy-size-touch-min); min-height: var(--xy-size-touch-min); transform: translate(-50%,-50%); box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0; margin: 0; border: 0; border-radius: 0; background: transparent; }
.touch-overlay::after { border: 0; }
